        {
          "name": "515915-un-one-from-the-expanse-tv-show-1100-scale-c53149e9-3e04-47d5-a077-2c744a3648a2.pdf",
          "bytes": 1264319,
          "sha256": "1102ec15501c0e2f01621b1e6509618cfc695c9d2d2f88f41751f70bbb6b95b0",
          "text": "3D\n\nM\nO\n\nD\n\nEL\n\nO\n\nN\n\nLY\n\nUN One From THE\nEXPANSE TV show 1:100 Scale\nLionel SAVOCA\n\nVIEW IN BROWSER\nupdated 13. 12. 2023 | published 13. 12. 2023\n\nSummary\nModel of the UN One from the TV show THE EXPANSE at 1:100 scale (52cm\nlong)\nTabletop Miniatures > Vehicles & Machines\nTags: space\nunitednations\n\nspaceship\n\nscifi\n\nexpanse\n\ntheexpanse\n\nmcrn\n\nunone\n\nHere is my own interpretation of the UN One form The Expanse. The model\nis design at 1:100 and mesure around 52 centimeter long but designed to\nbe undersized until 40 % size without issues (1:250 scale - 21 cm long). It\ncan be printed on a standard Printer or with MMU.\nHere is printing size and scale table guide :\n\n\fPrinting size\n100%\n67%\n50%\n40%\n\nScale\n1:100\n1:150\n1:200\n1:250\n\nLenght\n52 cm\n35 cm\n26cm\n21 cm\n\ncomment\nalmost same scale than MartinTaichl's Rocinante (1\n\nThe details on the shell are embossed to facilitate the painting both in\nprusa slicer in case of MMU and with a brush.\nThe 100% size print needs around 1,4Kg of filament and 250 hours of\nprinting.\nINFORMATION : to avoid the theft and resale of 3D models, an\nannotation has been added to some 3Ds, however this annotation is small\nenough to be ignored by the slicer when slicing.\nHere is the assembly instructions :\n\n\f\f\fModel files\nun-one-body-front.stl\n\nun-one-body-center.stl\n\nun-one-body-rear-1.stl\n\nun-one-body-rear-2.stl\n\nun-one-engines.stl\n\nun-one-wing-l.stl\n\nun-one-wing-r.stl\n\nun-one-connector-body-fu.stl\n\nun-one-connector-body-fb.stl\n\n\fun-one-connector-body-ru.stl\n\nun-one-connector-body-rb.stl\n\nun-one-connector-c1-x8.stl\n\nun-one-body-rear-up-l.stl\n\nun-one-body-rear-up-r.stl\n\nun-one-body-rear-bottom-l.stl\n\nun-one-body-rear-bottom-r.stl\n\nun-one-connector-r1-x2.stl\n\nun-one-connector-wing-l.stl\n\nun-one-connector-wing-r.stl\n\n\fun-one-stand.stl\n\nun-one-stand-interface.stl\n\nLicense \uf1f9\nThis work is licensed under a\nCreative Commons (4.0 International License)\nAttribution-ShareAlike\n\n\u2716 | Sharing without ATTRIBUTION\n\u2714 | Remix Culture allowed\n\u2714 | Commercial Use\n\u2714 | Free Cultural Works\n\u2714 | Meets Open Definition\n\n\f"
        }
      ]
